    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dress the Duel&quot; is a roguelike deckbuilding game where your cards are your wardrobe and your outfit is your arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a versatile wardrobe, <strong>disrobe</strong> strategically, <strong>layer</strong> outfits for powerful effects, and <strong>Dress</strong> the Duel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wardrobe-based card system: Your deck is your closet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic layering mechanics: Combine up to four layers for maximum effect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tactical disrobing: Remove layers of clothing for powerful bonuses or to counter enemy attacks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic dress-up system: Watch your avatar change with every card played</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Synergistic outfit combinations: Discover powerful interactions between costumes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Roguelike deckbuilding: Expand your wardrobe as you progress through each run</p>",
